// Nxeon (Cyrus v5): the handoff's local store, with the REAL account behind it.
//  - Minecraft projects are the account's builds (`real`, derived from ModBuild rows by
//    lib/cyrus/real.ts); their notes / restore / favourite are saved to the DB, their files load
//    from the build service. Nothing about them is kept in localStorage.
//  - Template games (everything Cyrus doesn't compile yet) keep the handoff's local mods,
//    persisted per account (`cyrus-state-v1:<userId>`).
//  - There is no local credit counter: tokens are the real economy (components/cyrus-tokens).
//  - The theme is the PORTAL's (html[data-theme], localStorage "nx-theme"); `theme` here only
//    mirrors it so the canvas/shaders can read it.
