// inside the portal frame (the portal's own sidebar and top bar stay; the studio fills the
// content area, see app/dashboard/cyrus/layout.tsx + studio.css).
//
// What is REAL here (Nxeon) and what is the handoff's:
//  - the account's Minecraft projects are its builds (lib/cyrus/real.ts), loaded by the server page
